{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The \"install library\" step for a registered repo whose HEAD was moved from outside (merge from master, pull, branch switch) - called by update_from_master, start_branch, abandon_branch and dev.github.update; callable by hand. Runs diff --name-status old_head new_head -- data (new_head \"\" = the current HEAD) and makes the running instance match: a change under data/<lib>/_APPS/<app>/ runs dev.dev.refresh_apps (shipped files replace runtime/<app>'s, app.properties included; botd.properties kept; files deleted upstream deleted; an app new to this box is copied in INACTIVE - config.properties apps= is never written); any other change under data/<lib>/ runs dev.dev.activate_lib (rebuild; FFI libraries hot-load). An app whose bundle was removed upstream is reported only. Acts only on libraries whose data/<lib> on this instance IS the repo's data/<lib>; core libraries (app, dev, peer, security), libraries not installed from this repo, and the instance's own checkout are reported under skipped and left alone. Never panics: problems land in the result. Returns FLAT {status, changed, restart (a static library's Rust changed - restart to load it), old_head, new_head, msg, libs:[{lib, apps (refresh_apps result), apps_removed_upstream, activate, restart}], skipped:[{lib, why}], steps:[one sentence per action]}.","import":"use ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse std::collections::BTreeMap;\nuse std::path::Path;","params":[{"name":"repo","type":"String"},{"name":"old_head","type":"String"},{"name":"new_head","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"gjymhm1a1fa195533h4","readers":[],"time":1795197366884,"username":"system","writers":[]}